Depends: ${misc:Depends}, perl, python3, patch,
         pve-qemu-kvm (>= 10.0), qemu-server (>= 9.1.17), pve-manager (>= 9.0)
Conflicts: pve-microvm
Description: Experimental virtio-mem integration for Proxmox VE Q35 guests
 Reuses Proxmox VE memory scheduling and QEMU virtio-mem to manage removable
 guest RAM. Includes guarded source patches and Debian upgrade triggers.
 No custom boot service, scheduler daemon, kernel or GPU driver is installed.
